   "ResearcherNotesProject": "Gregor, Aug 2026: Note that this project is entirely separate from the Energía 2000 Manzanillo FSRU (Project ID: L100000131094) that began operating nearby in early 2026. The Manzanillo Gas & Power terminal was originally proposed as an onshore terminal. Owner's website has recently changed to describe it as an offshore terminal, and an IDB Invest document from March 2025 clearly states that there will be an associated FSRU; however, no specific vessel has yet been identified:\nhttps://sapfnidbinvestrm.blob.core.windows.net/atidocs/English/EZSHARE-1377312999-23/Manzanillo%20Bay%20Energy%20-%20Environmental%20and%20Social%20Strategy%20-%20ESS.pdf. \n\nOlder version of company website describes terminal capacity as 1 mtpa, but current website no longer provides capacity data. Construction was said to be 40% complete as of January 2026, though it's not clear whether this refers to the terminal or the associated gas plants: https://listindiario.com/la-republica/20260130/manzanillo-g-p-logra-inversion-energia_891966.html",
